her cool nor beneficial."}},"45":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّهُمْ","d":"innahum","e":"Indeed they"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"were"},{"c":"قَبْلَ","d":"qabla","e":"before"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"مُتْرَفِينَ","d":"mut'rafīna","e":"indulging in affluence"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed they were, before that, indulging in affluence,"}},"46":{"w":[{"c":"وَكَانُوا","d":"wakānū","e":"And were"},{"c":"يُصِرُّونَ","d":"yuṣirrūna","e":"persisting"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"in"},{"c":"الْحِنْثِ","d":"l-ḥinthi","e":"the sin"},{"c":"الْعَظِيمِ","d":"l-ʿaẓīmi","e":"the great"}],"a":{"g":"And they used to persist in the great violation,"}},"47":{"w":[{"c":"وَكَانُوا","d":"wakānū","e":"And they used (to)"},{"c":"يَقُولُونَ","d":"yaqūlūna","e":"say"},{"c":"أَءِذَا","d":"a-idhā","e":"When"},{"c":"مِتْنَا","d":"mit'nā","e":"we die"},{"c":"وَكُنَّا","d":"wakunnā","e":"and become"},{"c":"تُرَابًا","d":"turāban","e":"dust"},{"c":"وَعِظَامًا","d":"waʿiẓāman","e":"and bones"},{"c":"أَءِنَّا","d":"a-innā","e":"will we"},{"c":"لَمَبْعُوثُونَ","d":"lamabʿūthūna","e":"surely be resurrected"}],"a":{"g":"And they used to say, \"When we die and become dust and bones, are we indeed to be resurrected?"}},"48":{"w":[{"c":"أَوَءَابَاؤُنَا","d":"awaābāunā","e":"And also"},{"c":"الْأَوَّلُونَ","d":"l-awalūna","e":"our forefathers"}],"a":{"g":"And our forefathers [as well]?\""}},"49":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الْأَوَّلِينَ","d":"l-awalīna","e":"the former"},{"c":"وَالْءَاخِرِينَ","d":"wal-ākhirīna","e":"and the later people"}],"a":{"g":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"Indeed, the former and the later peoples"}},"50":{"w":[{"c":"لَمَجْمُوعُونَ","d":"lamajmūʿūna","e":"Surely will be gathered"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"for"},{"c":"مِيقَاتِ","d":"mīqāti","e":"(the) appointment"},{"c":"يَوْمٍ","d":"yawmin","e":"(of) a Day"},{"c":"مَعْلُومٍ","d":"maʿlūmin","e":"well-known"}],"a":{"g":"Are to be gathered together for the appointment of a known Day.\""}},"51":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"إِنَّكُمْ","d":"innakum","e":"indeed you"},{"c":"أَيُّهَا","d":"ayyuhā","e":"O those astray"},{"c":"الضَّالُّونَ","d":"l-ḍālūna","e":"O those astray"},{"c":"الْمُكَذِّبُونَ","d":"l-mukadhibūna","e":"the deniers"}],"a":{"g":"Then indeed you, O those astray [who are] deniers,"}},"52":{"w":[{"c":"لَءَاكِلُونَ","d":"laākilūna","e":"Will surely eat"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"شَجَرٍ","d":"shajarin","e":"(the) tree"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"زَقُّومٍ","d":"zaqqūmin","e":"Zaqqum"}],"a":{"g":"Will be eating from trees of zaqqum"}},"53":{"w":[{"c":"فَمَالِئُونَ","d":"famāliūna","e":"Then will fill"},{"c":"مِنْهَا","d":"min'hā","e":"with it"},{"c":"الْبُطُونَ","d":"l-buṭūna","e":"the bellies"}],"a":{"g":"And filling with it your bellies"}},"54":{"w":[{"c":"فَشَارِبُونَ","d":"fashāribūna","e":"And drink"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِ","d":"ʿalayhi","e":"over it"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"[from]"},{"c":"الْحَمِيمِ","d":"l-ḥamīmi","e":"the scalding water"}],"a":{"g":"And drinking on top of it from scalding water"}},"55":{"w":[{"c":"فَشَارِبُونَ","d":"fashāribūna","e":"And will drink"},{"c":"شُرْبَ","d":"shur'ba","e":"(as) drinking"},{"c":"الْهِيمِ","d":"l-hīmi","e":"(of) the thirsty camels"}],"a":{"g":"And will drink as the drinking of thirsty camels."}},"56":{"w":[{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"نُزُلُهُمْ","d":"nuzuluhum","e":"(is) their hospitality"},{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(on the) Day"},{"c":"الدِّينِ","d":"l-dīni","e":"(of) Judgment"}],"a":{"g":"That is their accommodation on the Day of Recompense."}},"57":{"w":[{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"We"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَاكُمْ","d":"khalaqnākum","e":"[We] created you"},{"c":"فَلَوْلَا","d":"falawlā","e":"so why (do) not"},{"c":"تُصَدِّقُونَ","d":"tuṣaddiqūna","e":"you admit the truth"}],"a":{"g":"We have created you, so why do you not believe?"}},"58":{"w":[{"c":"أَفَرَءَيْتُمْ","d":"afara-aytum","e":"Do you see"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"تُمْنُونَ","d":"tum'nūna","e":"you emit"}],"a":{"g":"Have you seen that which you emit?"}},"59":{"w":[{"c":"ءَأَنْتُمْ","d":"a-antum","e":"Is it you"},{"c":"تَخْلُقُونَهُ","d":"takhluqūnahu","e":"who create it"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or"},{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"(are) We"},{"c":"الْخَالِقُونَ","d":"l-khāliqūna","e":"the Creators"}],"a":{"g":"Is it you who creates it, or are We the Creator?"}},"60":{"w":[{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"We"},{"c":"قَدَّرْنَا","d":"qaddarnā","e":"[We] have decreed"},{"c":"بَيْنَكُمُ","d":"baynakumu","e":"among you"},{"c":"الْمَوْتَ","d":"l-mawta","e":"the death"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"We"},{"c":"بِمَسْبُوقِينَ","d":"bimasbūqīna","e":"(are) outrun"}],"a":{"g":"We have decreed death among you, and We are not to be outdone"}},"61":{"w":[{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"In"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"نُبَدِّلَ","d":"nubaddila","e":"We (will) change"},{"c":"أَمْثَالَكُمْ","d":"amthālakum","e":"your likeness[es]"},{"c":"وَنُنْشِئَكُمْ","d":"wanunshi-akum","e":"and produce you"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"تَعْلَمُونَ","d":"taʿlamūna","e":"you know"}],"a":{"g":"In that We will change your likenesses and produce you in that [form] which you do not know."}},"62":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"عَلِمْتُمُ","d":"ʿalim'tumu","e":"you know"},{"c":"النَّشْأَةَ","d":"l-nashata","e":"the creation"},{"c":"الْأُولَى","d":"l-ūlā","e":"the first"},{"c":"فَلَوْلَا","d":"falawlā","e":"so why not"},{"c":"تَذَكَّرُونَ","d":"tadhakkarūna","e":"you take heed"}],"a":{"g":"And you have already known the first creation, so will you not remember?"}},"63":{"w":[{"c":"أَفَرَءَيْتُمْ","d":"afara-aytum","e":"And do you see"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"تَحْرُثُونَ","d":"taḥruthūna","e":"you sow"}],"a":{"g":"And have you seen that [seed] which you sow?"}},"64":{"w":[{"c":"ءَأَنْتُمْ","d":"a-antum","e":"Is it you (who)"},{"c":"تَزْرَعُونَهُ","d":"tazraʿūnahu","e":"cause it to grow"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or"},{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"(are) We"},{"c":"الزَّارِعُونَ","d":"l-zāriʿūna","e":"the Ones Who grow"}],"a":{"g":"Is it you who makes it grow, or are We the grower?"}},"65":{"w":[{"c":"لَوْ","d":"law","e":"If"},{"c":"نَشَاءُ","d":"nashāu","e":"We willed"},{"c":"لَجَعَلْنَاهُ","d":"lajaʿalnāhu","e":"We (would) surely make it"},{"c":"حُطَامًا","d":"ḥuṭāman","e":"debris"},{"c":"فَظَلْتُمْ","d":"faẓaltum","e":"then you would remain"},{"c":"تَفَكَّهُونَ","d":"tafakkahūna","e":"wondering"}],"a":{"g":"If We willed, We could make it [dry] debris, and you would remain in wonder,"}},"66":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed we"},{"c":"لَمُغْرَمُونَ","d":"lamugh'ramūna","e":"surely are laden with debt"}],"a":{"g":"[Saying], \"Indeed, we are [now] in debt;"}},"67":{"w":[{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay"},{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"we"},{"c":"مَحْرُومُونَ","d":"maḥrūmūna","e":"(are) deprived"}],"a":{"g":"Rather, we have been deprived.\""}},"68":{"w":[{"c":"أَفَرَءَيْتُمُ","d":"afara-aytumu","e":"Do you see"},{"c":"الْمَاءَ","d":"l-māa","e":"the water"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"which"},{"c":"تَشْرَبُونَ","d":"tashrabūna","e":"you drink"}],"a":{"g":"And have you seen the water that you drink?"}},"69":{"w":[{"c":"ءَأَنْتُمْ","d":"a-antum","e":"Is it you"},{"c":"أَنْزَلْتُمُوهُ","d":"anzaltumūhu","e":"who send it down"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"الْمُزْنِ","d":"l-muz'ni","e":"the rain clouds"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or"},{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"We"},{"c":"الْمُنْزِلُونَ","d":"l-munzilūna","e":"(are) the Ones to send"}],"a":{"g":"Is it you who brought it down from the clouds, or is it We who bring it down?"}},"70":{"w":[{"c":"لَوْ","d":"law","e":"If"},{"c":"نَشَاءُ","d":"nashāu","e":"We willed"},{"c":"جَعَلْنَاهُ","d":"jaʿalnāhu","e":"We (could) make it"},{"c":"أُجَاجًا","d":"ujājan","e":"salty"},{"c":"فَلَوْلَا","d":"falawlā","e":"then why are you not grateful"},{"c":"تَشْكُرُونَ","d":"tashkurūna","e":"then why are you not grateful"}],"a":{"g":"If We willed, We could make it bitter, so why are you not grateful?"}},"71":{"w":[{"c":"أَفَرَءَيْتُمُ","d":"afara-aytumu","e":"Do you see"},{"c":"النَّارَ","d":"l-nāra","e":"the Fire"},{"c":"الَّتِي","d":"allatī","e":"which"},{"c":"تُورُونَ","d":"tūrūna","e":"you ignite"}],"a":{"g":"And have you seen the fire that you ignite?"}},"72":{"w":[{"c":"ءَأَنْتُمْ","d":"a-antum","e":"Is it you"},{"c":"أَنْشَأْتُمْ","d":"anshatum","e":"who produced"},{"c":"شَجَرَتَهَا","d":"shajaratahā","e":"its tree"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or"},{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"We"},{"c":"الْمُنْشِئُونَ","d":"l-munshiūna","e":"(are) the Producers"}],"a":{"g":"Is it you who produced its tree, or are We the producer?"}},"73":{"w":[{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"We"},{"c":"جَعَلْنَاهَا","d":"jaʿalnāhā","e":"have made it"},{"c":"تَذْكِرَةً","d":"tadhkiratan","e":"a reminder"},{"c":"وَمَتَاعًا","d":"wamatāʿan","e":"and a provision"},{"c":"لِلْمُقْوِينَ","d":"lil'muq'wīna","e":"for the wayfarers in the desert"}],"a":{"g":"We have made it a reminder and provision for the travelers,"}},"74":{"w":[{"c":"فَسَبِّحْ","d":"fasabbiḥ","e":"So glorify"},{"c":"بِاسْمِ","d":"bi-is'mi","e":"(the) name"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"الْعَظِيمِ","d":"l-ʿaẓīmi","e":"the Most Great"}],"a":{"g":"So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great."}},"75":{"w":[{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"But nay"},{"c":"أُقْسِمُ","d":"uq'simu","e":"I swear"},{"c":"بِمَوَاقِعِ","d":"bimawāqiʿi","e":"by setting"},{"c":"النُّجُومِ","d":"l-nujūmi","e":"(of) the stars"}],"a":{"g":"Then I swear by the setting of the stars,"}},"76":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّهُ","d":"wa-innahu","e":"And indeed it"},{"c":"لَقَسَمٌ","d":"laqasamun","e":"(is) surely an oath"},{"c":"لَوْ","d":"law","e":"if"},{"c":"تَعْلَمُونَ","d":"taʿlamūna","e":"you know"},{"c":"عَظِيمٌ","d":"ʿaẓīmun","e":"great"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, it is an oath - if you could know - [most] great."}},"77":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed it"},{"c":"لَقُرْءَانٌ","d":"laqur'ānun","e":"(is) surely a Quran"},{"c":"كَرِيمٌ","d":"karīmun","e":"noble"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, it is a noble Qur'an"}},"78":{"w":[{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"In"},{"c":"كِتَابٍ","d":"kitābin","e":"a Book"},{"c":"مَكْنُونٍ","d":"maknūnin","e":"well-guarded"}],"a":{"g":"In a Register well-protected;"}},"79":{"w":[{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"None"},{"c":"يَمَسُّهُ","d":"yamassuhu","e":"touch it"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"الْمُطَهَّرُونَ","d":"l-muṭaharūna","e":"the purified"}],"a":{"g":"None touch it except the purified."}},"80":{"w":[{"c":"تَنْزِيلٌ","d":"tanzīlun","e":"A Revelation"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"رَبِّ","d":"rabbi","e":"(the) Lord"},{"c":"الْعَالَمِينَ","d":"l-ʿālamīna","e":"(of) the worlds"}],"a":{"g":"[It is] a revelation from the Lord of the worlds."}},"81":{"w":[{"c":"أَفَبِهَذَا","d":"afabihādhā","e":"Then is it to this"},{"c":"الْحَدِيثِ","d":"l-ḥadīthi","e":"statement"},{"c":"أَنْتُمْ","d":"antum","e":"that you"},{"c":"مُدْهِنُونَ","d":"mud'hinūna","e":"(are) indifferent"}],"a":{"g":"Then is it to this statement that you are indifferent"}},"82":{"w":[{"c":"وَتَجْعَلُونَ","d":"watajʿalūna","e":"And you make"},{"c":"رِزْقَكُمْ","d":"riz'qakum","e":"your provision"},{"c":"أَنَّكُمْ","d":"annakum","e":"that you"},{"c":"تُكَذِّبُونَ","d":"tukadhibūna","e":"deny"}],"a":{"g":"And make [the thanks for] your provision that you deny [the Provider]?"}},"83":{"w":[{"c":"فَلَوْلَا","d":"falawlā","e":"Then why not"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"بَلَغَتِ","d":"balaghati","e":"it reaches"},{"c":"الْحُلْقُومَ","d":"l-ḥul'qūma","e":"the throat"}],"a":{"g":"Then why, when the soul at death reaches the throat"}},"84":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنْتُمْ","d":"wa-antum","e":"And you"},{"c":"حِينَئِذٍ","d":"ḥīna-idhin","e":"(at) that time"},{"c":"تَنْظُرُونَ","d":"tanẓurūna","e":"look on"}],"a":{"g":"And you are at that time looking on -"}},"85":{"w":[{"c":"وَنَحْنُ","d":"wanaḥnu","e":"And We"},{"c":"أَقْرَبُ","d":"aqrabu","e":"(are) nearer"},{"c":"إِلَيْهِ","d":"ilayhi","e":"to him"},{"c":"مِنْكُمْ","d":"minkum","e":"than you"},{"c":"وَلَكِنْ","d":"walākin","e":"but"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"you (do) not see"},{"c":"تُبْصِرُونَ","d":"tub'ṣirūna","e":"you (do) not see"}],"a":{"g":"And Our angels are nearer to him than you, but you do not see -"}},"86":{"w":[{"c":"فَلَوْلَا","d":"falawlā","e":"Then why not"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you are"},{"c":"غَيْرَ","d":"ghayra","e":"not"},{"c":"مَدِينِينَ","d":"madīnīna","e":"to be recompensed"}],"a":{"g":"Then why do you not, if you are not to be recompensed,"}},"87":{"w":[{"c":"تَرْجِعُونَهَا","d":"tarjiʿūnahā","e":"Bring it back"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you are"},{"c":"صَادِقِينَ","d":"ṣādiqīna","e":"truthful"}],"a":{"g":"Bring it back, if you should be truthful?"}},"88":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَمَّا","d":"fa-ammā","e":"Then"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"he was"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْمُقَرَّبِينَ","d":"l-muqarabīna","e":"those brought near"}],"a":{"g":"And if the deceased was of those brought near to Allah,"}},"89":{"w":[{"c":"فَرَوْحٌ","d":"farawḥun","e":"Then rest"},{"c":"وَرَيْحَانٌ","d":"warayḥānun","e":"and bounty"},{"c":"وَجَنَّتُ","d":"wajannatu","e":"and a Garden"},{"c":"نَعِيمٍ","d":"naʿīmin","e":"(of) Pleasure"}],"a":{"g":"Then [for him is] rest and bounty and a garden of pleasure."}},"90":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَمَّا","d":"wa-ammā","e":"And"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"he was"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"أَصْحَابِ","d":"aṣḥābi","e":"(the) companions"},{"c":"الْيَمِينِ","d":"l-yamīni","e":"(of) the right"}],"a":{"g":"And if he was of the companions of the right,"}},"91":{"w":[{"c":"فَسَلَامٌ","d":"fasalāmun","e":"Then peace"},{"c":"لَكَ","d":"laka","e":"for you"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"[from]"},{"c":"أَصْحَابِ","d":"aṣḥābi","e":"(the) companions"},{"c":"الْيَمِينِ","d":"l-yamīni","e":"(of) the right"}],"a":{"g":"Then [the angels will say], \"Peace for you; [you are] from the companions of the right.\""}},"92":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَمَّا","d":"wa-ammā","e":"But"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"he was"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْمُكَذِّبِينَ","d":"l-mukadhibīna","e":"the deniers"},{"c":"الضَّالِّينَ","d":"l-ḍālīna","e":"the astray"}],"a":{"g":"But if he was of the deniers [who were] astray,"}},"93":{"w":[{"c":"فَنُزُلٌ","d":"fanuzulun","e":"Then hospitality"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"حَمِيمٍ","d":"ḥamīmin","e":"(the) scalding water"}],"a":{"g":"Then [for him is] accommodation of scalding water"}},"94":{"w":[{"c":"وَتَصْلِيَةُ","d":"wataṣliyatu","e":"And burning"},{"c":"جَحِيمٍ","d":"jaḥīmin","e":"(in) Hellfire"}],"a":{"g":"And burning in Hellfire"}},"95":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"this"},{"c":"لَهُوَ","d":"lahuwa","e":"surely it"},{"c":"حَقُّ","d":"ḥaqqu","e":"(is the) truth"},{"c":"الْيَقِينِ","d":"l-yaqīni","e":"certain"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, this is the true certainty,"}},"96":{"w":[{"c":"فَسَبِّحْ","d":"fasabbiḥ","e":"So glorify"},{"c":"بِاسْمِ","d":"bi-is'mi","e":"(the) name"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"الْعَظِيمِ","d":"l-ʿaẓīmi","e":"the Most Great"}],"a":{"g":"So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great."}}}